                    <description>Write 0 has no effect. Read 0 means that the trigger can be set again to 1.</description>
                    <value>0x0</value>
                  </enumeratedValue>
                  <enumeratedValue>
                    <name>B_0x1</name>
                    <description>Write 1 generates a positive pulse on the adf_trgo signal and triggers the acquisition on enabled filter having their ACQMOD[2:0] = 01x and selecting TRGO as trigger. Read 1 means that the trigger pulse is still active.</description>
                    <value>0x1</value>
                  </enumeratedValue>
                </enumeratedValues>
              </field>
