                    <description>Vless thansub&gt;DDIO4less than/sub&gt; is not present. Logical and electrical isolation is applied to ignore this supply.</description>
                    <value>0x0</value>
                  </enumeratedValue>
                  <enumeratedValue>
                    <name>B_0x1</name>
                    <description>Vless thansub&gt;DDIO4less than/sub&gt; is valid.</description>
